From ae7362db60d8c2ad112c649f780d761eb930cd74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:04:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - vehicle module, spellclick, vendors, runner
 condition/vehicle/lock logic (Kezan)

- vehicle module: SMSG_CLIENT_CONTROL_UPDATE -> CMSG_SET_ACTIVE_MOVER + move.set_mover (movement
  must carry the controlled vehicle's guid), SMSG_PET_SPELLS action bar, enter (spellclick),
  exit (CMSG_REQUEST_VEHICLE_EXIT), cast (CMSG_CAST_SPELL as the vehicle)
- move: set_mover; movement, teleport and speed acks use the mover guid
- interact: spellclick (CMSG_SPELLCLICK), vendor_list/vendor_buy, unit run speed
- runner: quest-availability conditions (source 19: rewarded/taken/none/class/race/gender/
  item/complete, references, else-groups), spellclick credit, SAI spell-hit objectives fired
  from the vehicle bar (summon the vehicle with the quest item, drive, cast), credit-only
  entries via quest item use, vendor-sold quest items, chest opening spell from the Lock.dbc
  lock type (21 Open From Vehicle -> 61437), leave vehicles before quest givers
- Kezan pass 3: 14069 (spellclick trolls), 14071 Rolling with my Homies (Hot Rod: summon,
  drive, Grab Passenger x3), 14070, 24567, 26712, 14109 (3 vendor buys), 28349, 25473 ...

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
